Trace the bootstrap milestone right after the trust cache setup

The boot stops after "OSLog stream configured" and no later bootstrap log
line reaches the framebuffer console. Print the entry of
OSKextRemoveKextBootstrap() and machine_lockdown() on the console itself so
the stall can be located without the OSLog ring.

--- a/osfmk/kern/startup.c
+++ b/osfmk/kern/startup.c
@@ -762,0 +763,1 @@
+        printf("TULIP BOOT: into OSKextRemoveKextBootstrap\n");
@@ -769,0 +771,1 @@
+        printf("TULIP BOOT: into machine_lockdown\n");
